              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icika alac ame onwoŋo tye iye onwoŋo otikere i dyekal alac me oko, cal yen otit daŋ onwoŋo tye ame okwogo kede kor apama me yie, acel tuŋ cel, kede acel tuŋ cel. Rwom me yito malo dogcellidaŋ onwoŋo tye aboro.",
