        },
        {
          "text": "En dok te tera i doggola ame donyo i ot Obaŋa. En te pimo doggola me donyo iye, te nwoŋo borrere tye futi aboro, laccere futi pyeraryo wie adek, eka lac apama mere te bedo futi abic. ",
